# Slice 2.5 Architecture — Side-car `@slayzone/server` shell

End state after slice 2.5: Electron main spawns a supervised Node side-car subprocess. Side-car hosts the tRPC WS server (empty `appRouter`). All existing IPC handlers stay in Electron main untouched.

