| IPC | Direction | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `app:get-trpc-port` | invoke → main | Returns supervisor's bound port (await ready). Rewritten this slice. |
| `app:wait-for-server-ready` | invoke → main | NEW. Resolves on first /health 200, rejects on permanent failure. |
| `app:embedded-server-failed` | main → renderer | NEW. Permanent-failure broadcast. Swap to fallback screen. |

Slice 7 replaces the failure event w/ tRPC subscription. This slice uses plain IPC since router is empty.

