## Failure modes + recovery

| Failure | Detection | Recovery |
|---|---|---|
| Side-car crash after ready | `child.on('exit')` while `health='ready'` | Restart immediately (attempt counter not bumped) |
| Side-car fails to bind port | 10s `/health` timeout | SIGKILL child, `attempt++`, backoff `BACKOFF_MS[attempt-1]` |
| Side-car repeatedly fails | `attempt > 5` | `onPermanentFailure` → renderer shows `<ServerFailedScreen />` |
| Electron `kill -9`'d | OS reaps child via SIGCHLD process group | side-car exits cleanly (or orphan reaped by `pgrep` cleanup in next launch's global-setup) |
| Both processes try migrate DB | N/A this slice | Migrations stay in Electron only. Side-car opens already-migrated DB. |

